        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hey everyone! Hanna gave me a bit of a poke in the forum&#39;s direction and mentioned it&#39;d be a good idea to show up here, so here I am!</p><p>I&#39;m Rowan Walker from Sydney. I demoed Galactic Strike Force for the three days at PAX Aus 2014, and LOVED every minute of it! Almost lost my voice though :D</p><p>I love Sentinels and GSF, and have only played a little of Tactics. I picked up GSF at PAX, and once my friend&#39;s returned it to me I&#39;ll be demoing it to all my friends and family!</p><p>Besides board games I&#39;m a hardcore PC gamer, a pianist, a composer, a programmer, and a whole bunch of other fun things!</p><p>You can find out more at http://archmage.me where I&#39;ve actually done an intro for myself :D</p><p>Hope to hear from all of you cool folks soon!</p><p>-Rowan</p>",
