        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/7ea924/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-06T16:56:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I really need to update that Urban Dead section: I'm pretty inactive at the moment. Hard to find time to run three characters with everything I do in a day :D</p><p>It's nice to be appreciated! I really did have a lot of fun with it, and I'm glad I was able to help people and cover others' inexperience with GSF at the same time :)</p><p>It worked out to be really convenient!</p>",
